          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "7. What is 5% of 40? What is 40% of 5? What is 25% of 12? What is 12% of 25? What is 15% of 60? What is 60% of 15? What do you notice? Can you make a general statement and justify it using algebra, comparing x% of y and y% of x?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.173,
            0.229,
            0.593,
            0.284
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "8. A school is organising an excursion for its students. 40% of them are Grade 8 students and the rest are Grade 9"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
